␀r␀&␀␀␀ €!␀€␀␀␀˜€€␀␀‚ÿ␀PuTTY and its associated tools support a range of command-line options, most of which are consistent across all the tools. This section lists the available options in all tools. Options which are specific to a particular tool are covered in the chapter about that tool.␀␀f␀␀␀4␀␀␀<␀Ø␀2␀␀␀ 4€h␀€␀␀␀␀ã×ÄùN€␀␀€␀␀€␀€␀␀‰‚ÿ␀␀Section 3.8.3.1␀: ␀-load␀: load a saved session␀␀␀¥␀␀␀[␀␀␀r␀}␀J␀␀␀ d€¶␀€␀␀␀␀ãÎÄùN€␀␀€␀␀€␀␀€␀€␀␀€␀€␀␀€␀€␀␀€␀€␀␀€␀‰‚ÿ␀␀Section 3.8.3.2␀: ␀Selecting a protocol: ␀-ssh␀, ␀-telnet␀, ␀-rlogin␀, ␀-raw␀ ␀-serial␀␀␀a␀␀␀/␀␀␀Ø␀Ş␀2␀␀␀ 4€^␀€␀␀␀␀ãÏÄùN€␀␀€␀␀€␀€␀␀‰‚ÿ␀␀Section 3.8.3.3␀: ␀-v␀: increase verbosity␀␀␀c␀␀␀1␀␀␀}␀A␀2␀␀␀ 4€b␀€␀␀␀␀ãĞÄùN€␀␀€␀␀€␀€␀␀‰‚ÿ␀␀Section 3.8.3.4␀: ␀-l␀: specify a login name␀␀␀␀␀␀C␀␀␀Ş␀Â␀>␀␀␀ L€†␀€␀␀␀␀ãÑÄùN€␀␀€␀␀€␀€␀␀€␀€␀␀€␀€␀␀‰‚ÿ␀␀Section 3.8.3.5␀: ␀-L␀, ␀-R␀ and ␀-D␀: set up port forwardings␀␀␀z␀␀␀H␀␀␀A␀<␀2␀␀␀ 4€␀€␀␀␀␀ãÒÄùN€␀␀€␀␀€␀€␀␀‰‚ÿ␀␀Section 3.8.3.6␀: ␀-m␀: read a remote command or script from a file␀␀␀d␀␀␀2␀␀␀Â␀ ␀2␀␀␀ 4€d␀€␀␀␀␀ãÓÄùN€␀␀€␀␀€␀€␀␀‰‚ÿ␀␀Section 3.8.3.7␀: ␀-P␀: specify a port number␀␀␀b␀␀␀0␀␀␀<␀@␀2␀␀␀ 4€`␀€␀␀␀␀ãÔÄùN€␀␀€␀␀€␀€␀␀‰‚ÿ␀␀Section 3.8.3.8␀: ␀-pw␀: specify a password␀ ␀@␀U
