␀,␀␀␀ &€‡␀€␀␀␀˜€€␀␀€␀€␀␀‚ÿ␀This option is enabled by default. If it is disabled, PuTTY will ignore any control sequences sent by the server which use the extended 256-colour mode supported by recent versions of ␀xterm␀.␀␀|␀␀J␀␀şƒ
