␀)␀␀␀ "€x␀€␀␀␀␀€␀€␀€␀‚ÿ␀Section 4.18.2␀: ␀‘Don't start a shell or command at all’␀␀D␀␀␀␀
␀´␀&␀␀␀ €=␀€␀␀␀˜€€␀␀‚ÿ␀If you tick this box, PuTTY will not attempt to run a shell or command after connecting to the remote server. You might want to use this option if you are only using the SSH connection for port forwarding, and your user account on the server does not have the ability to run a shell.␀␀­␀␀␀‡␀␀␀p
